See LICENSE and COPYRIGHT. Beam68-derived release tools retain their MIT
notice in licenses/Beam68-release-tools.txt.

The Source drawer in the runtime archive and the versioned source ZIP contain the
corresponding source, Makefile, SDK, release scripts and regression tests.
README.md and docs/RELEASING.md document rebuilding. VERSION identifies this
release; BUILD-PROVENANCE.json records exact native input/output hashes.
@ENDNODE
